<title>USA: Platforms Intl wins $10 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Platforms Intl wins $10 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>MOJAVE, Calif. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Platforms International Corp Monday said it has won a $10 million, five-year contract from Teledyne Ryan Aeronautical to provide flight hardware for a NASA project.</p>
</text>
